# Docs/logs that are never build inputs (CTR-P3-002). Deliberately narrow: a
# blanket `*.md`/`*.txt`/`*.log` would silently drop build-relevant files from
# the context (e.g. a future apps/web/public/robots.txt or sitemap .txt) with
# no error. Add paths here only when they cannot be a build input.
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
*.log
pnpm-debug.log*
